  "content": "<h1>Cube-ish Buckets Compats</h1>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmodpack%252felysium-days\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fyoncle/Elysium-Days/main/ed_badge.png\" alt=\"As seen in Elysium Days\" width=\"200\">\n</a></p>\n<p>This resourcepack adds mod compatibility to Cube-ish Buckets to make everything look perfect together!</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/df895c734b9d7309c3ef89fc797cd7cc94079960.png\" alt=\"Modded Buckets\"></p>\n<p>Update v2.0:</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f86c83003ad1036e139db08fdd7f5d49f99add3a.png\" alt=\"v2.0 Fishes\"></p>\n<h2>Совместимость:</h2>\n<table>\n<tr>\n  <td>\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmavm\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/zitu8weW/1c5c0ba1b3afa8889e8bbe152df5e2e5b13a2a92_96.webp\" width=\"32\">\n    </a>\n  </td>\n  <td>\n    <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmavm\" rel=\"nofollow\">More Axolotl Variants Mod</a></strong>\n  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n  <td>\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ftide\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/die1AF7i/092d1c739b014b6e6480188addb762c30c63f20a_96.webp\" width=\"32\">\n    </a>\n  </td>\n  <td>\n    <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ftide\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tide</a></strong>\n  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n  <td>\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fnether-depths-upgrade\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/vI1QKJro/e64111a7ee741940fdc5329b666a3b76845e461e_96.webp\" width=\"32\">\n    </a>\n  </td>\n  <td>\n    <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fnether-depths-upgrade\" re